The front's different.

1145
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:40,320
(Different bangs)
And?

1146
00:42:40,680 --> 00:42:41,480
And?

1147
00:42:42,780 --> 00:42:43,460
(Smiles)

1148
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:45,080
These two are watching the drama.

1149
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:46,520
And

1150
00:42:46,520 --> 00:42:48,000
the little bun in the back is different.

1151
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:49,080
How's it different?

1152
00:42:52,200 --> 00:42:54,600
Yesterday, the little bun was more...

1153
00:42:55,720 --> 00:42:56,820
There wasn't this little bun.

1154
00:42:57,020 --> 00:42:57,860
(Laughs out loud)

1155
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:59,380
Yesterday mine was over here.

1156
00:42:59,460 --> 00:43:01,500
(Yesterday's hairstyle)

1157
00:43:01,520 --> 00:43:02,080
Really?

1158
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:03,880
Over here?

1159
00:43:03,880 --> 00:43:04,560
Over here.

1160
00:43:04,560 --> 00:43:06,320
You even got the side wrong!

1161
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:08,880
Over here.

1162
00:43:09,800 --> 00:43:10,760
Cao Yiheng, do you still remember

1163
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:11,480
Cui Kaiyi's hairstyle yesterday?

1164
00:43:11,980 --> 00:43:13,780
(Paying attention)

1165
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,160
I remember.

1166
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:16,400
(Without hesitation)
What was it?

1167
00:43:16,400 --> 00:43:18,280
It was tied up in the back.

1168
00:43:18,280 --> 00:43:20,240
It was like

1169
00:43:20,240 --> 00:43:22,560
(Yesterday's hairstyle)
a bunch of braids twisted together,

1170
00:43:22,560 --> 00:43:23,880
like a flower.

1171
00:43:24,460 --> 00:43:27,460
(Satisfied)

1172
00:43:27,480 --> 00:43:28,160
Easy win.

1173
00:43:28,760 --> 00:43:29,840
How many nods was that?

1174
00:43:30,140 --> 00:43:32,220
(Smiles)

1175
00:43:33,960 --> 00:43:34,680
My eyebrows hurt.

1176
00:43:37,600 --> 00:43:38,520
I feel like even if Cao Yiheng

1177
00:43:38,520 --> 00:43:39,440
didn't actually remember,

1178
00:43:39,440 --> 00:43:40,880
that answer

1179
00:43:40,880 --> 00:43:42,240
would still make Cui Kaiyi happy.

1180
00:43:43,600 --> 00:43:44,160
I didn't remember.

1181
00:43:44,160 --> 00:43:45,560
I was only looking at your face.

1182
00:43:45,700 --> 00:43:47,340
(Smooth talker)

1183
00:43:47,360 --> 00:43:48,120
You...

1184
00:43:48,120 --> 00:43:49,880
You Scorpios love doing stuff like this.

1185
00:43:49,900 --> 00:43:51,380
(Proud)

1186
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:53,240
I...

1187
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:55,360
I could even ask
about the day before yesterday.

1188
00:44:00,040 --> 00:44:01,520
Searching memory...

1189
00:44:02,640 --> 00:44:04,240
Brain working overtime.

1190
00:44:04,700 --> 00:44:05,700
(Smiles to himself)

1191
00:44:09,480 --> 00:44:11,200
It's in my notebook.

1192
00:44:14,020 --> 00:44:15,540
(A week ago)

1193
00:44:15,560 --> 00:44:17,080
I'll note down your hairstyle today.

1194
00:44:18,080 --> 00:44:19,000
You got it?

1195
00:44:23,600 --> 00:44:24,440
Even if I forget,

1196
00:44:24,440 --> 00:44:26,180
my notebook won't.

1197
00:44:26,180 --> 00:44:28,660
(Even if I forget, my notebook won't)
Oh my God.

1198
00:44:28,660 --> 00:44:29,740
(Cupid, Yang Chaoyue)
Isn't he a mural artist?

1199
00:44:29,740 --> 00:44:31,000
He could draw her every day.

1200
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:31,880
A portrait every day.

1201
00:44:33,500 --> 00:44:35,100
(Six days ago)

1202
00:44:35,100 --> 00:44:36,740
(Five days ago)

1203
00:44:36,740 --> 00:44:37,500
(Four days ago)

1204
00:44:37,520 --> 00:44:38,660
He writes it down every day?

1205
00:44:38,660 --> 00:44:39,900
(Three days ago)

1206
00:44:39,900 --> 00:44:41,100
(Two days ago)
Oh my God.

1207
00:44:41,100 --> 00:44:42,660
(One day ago)

1208
00:44:43,140 --> 00:44:46,740
(I've quietly saved every version
of you in my heart)

1209
00:44:46,760 --> 00:44:47,760
Wait. Let me look.

1210
00:44:47,760 --> 00:44:49,240
Side braid.

1211
00:44:49,240 --> 00:44:50,760
Blue dress. Antenna hair.

1212
00:44:50,760 --> 00:44:52,640
Hair pinned up.

1213
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:54,400
He wrote down everything about her look.

1214
00:44:54,560 --> 00:44:55,440
That's so sweet.

1215
00:44:55,560 --> 00:44:58,120
How long has it been
since you used a notebook

1216
00:44:58,640 --> 00:45:01,280
(Hairstyle diary, house edition)
to keep track of your partner's

1217
00:45:01,280 --> 00:45:03,920
hair and outfits?

1218
00:45:04,360 --> 00:45:07,080
People sure get diligent
when they're dating.

1219
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:10,880
It's in my notebook.

1220
00:45:11,400 --> 00:45:12,520
That's so thoughtful.

1221
00:45:13,120 --> 00:45:15,040
But you wore a blue dress on Tuesday.

1222
00:45:15,840 --> 00:45:16,560
I honestly forgot

1223
00:45:16,560 --> 00:45:17,680
how I wore my hair Tuesday.

1224
00:45:17,960 --> 00:45:18,800
Cui...

1225
00:45:20,080 --> 00:45:20,760
Not bad.

1226
00:45:23,200 --> 00:45:24,400
I really don't remember.

1227
00:45:27,860 --> 00:45:29,060
(Glances)

1228
00:45:30,240 --> 00:45:31,180
Are you going somewhere?

1229
00:45:31,180 --> 00:45:31,620
(Asks)

1230
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:33,880
(Responds)
Wanna take a walk?

1231
00:45:34,200 --> 00:45:35,440
Can we take a walk?

1232
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:36,400
Sure.

1233
00:45:36,600 --> 00:45:37,440
Go.

1234
00:45:37,440 --> 00:45:38,280
It's fine. You guys go.

1235
00:45:38,280 --> 00:45:38,800
We'll clean up.

1236
00:45:38,800 --> 00:45:39,440
No, we'll do it.

1237
00:45:39,440 --> 00:45:40,320
We'll clean up.

1238
00:45:40,320 --> 00:45:41,440
You guys go take a break first.

1239
00:45:41,440 --> 00:45:42,440
(Rushing to help)
Go on. I'll clean up.

1240
00:45:42,440 --> 00:45:43,680
(Not backing down)
We're not leaving.

1241
00:45:43,680 --> 00:45:44,840
We'll wash the dishes.

1242
00:45:44,840 --> 00:45:46,480
You guys can handle
the rest of the trash.

1243
00:45:46,480 --> 00:45:47,480
(Teamwork)
We'll clean up.

1244
00:45:52,120 --> 00:45:52,920
Leave it there. I'll get it.

1245
00:45:53,240 --> 00:45:54,160
It's fine.

1246
00:45:56,800 --> 00:45:57,680
I'll wash them.

1247
00:45:57,680 --> 00:45:58,480
No.

1248
00:46:00,440 --> 00:46:01,640
I've already got the gloves on.

1249
00:46:01,680 --> 00:46:03,000
We don't need this.

1250
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:03,600
Do you want it?

1251
00:46:03,600 --> 00:46:04,480
No, you have it.

1252
00:46:04,480 --> 00:46:06,280
Then I'll take out the trash.

1253
00:46:06,560 --> 00:46:07,120
Okay.

1254
00:46:09,800 --> 00:46:11,760
We're done. Need any help?

1255
00:46:11,760 --> 00:46:12,400
We're good.

1256
00:46:12,400 --> 00:46:13,680
We're almost done washing up.

1257
00:46:13,680 --> 00:46:14,520
You guys go ahead.

1258
00:46:15,560 --> 00:46:16,480
(Thanks for your hard work)
Thanks.

1259
00:46:16,480 --> 00:46:17,760
No problem.

1260
00:46:19,000 --> 00:46:19,960
Why don't I do it?

1261
00:46:21,040 --> 00:46:22,120
No, don't get your hands dirty.

1262
00:46:22,120 --> 00:46:23,360
I'll be faster.

1263
00:46:23,360 --> 00:46:24,760
What's that supposed to mean? I'm slow?

1264
00:46:25,720 --> 00:46:26,360
I think I get it.

1265
00:46:26,360 --> 00:46:27,760
You're just too thorough.

1266
00:46:27,760 --> 00:46:29,040
You wash them too clean.

1267
00:46:38,160 --> 00:46:39,360
Wanna play ball or take a walk?

1268
00:46:40,160 --> 00:46:41,640
Let's go outside and see.

1269
00:46:44,000 --> 00:46:45,840
Look, the stargazing room is still lit.

1270
00:46:45,840 --> 00:46:46,520
Yeah.

1271
00:46:47,200 --> 00:46:47,720
So...

1272
00:46:47,720 --> 00:46:49,640
no one pressed it today either.

1273
00:46:50,960 --> 00:46:52,360
How do you know no one did?

1274
00:46:52,920 --> 00:46:54,240
Then maybe I just don't know.

1275
00:46:55,160 --> 00:46:55,880
Wanna go down?

1276
00:46:55,880 --> 00:46:56,440
Let's go.

1277
00:46:56,440 --> 00:46:57,080
Come on.

1278
00:47:00,120 --> 00:47:01,080
Have you tried this?

1279
00:47:01,080 --> 00:47:01,720
No.

1280
00:47:01,720 --> 00:47:02,600
Wanna try?

1281
00:47:02,600 --> 00:47:03,560
Let's do it together.

1282
00:47:03,640 --> 00:47:04,600
Let me see.

1283
00:47:06,260 --> 00:47:07,220
(Shows him)

1284
00:47:07,520 --> 00:47:08,000
So, wanna try?

1285
00:47:08,000 --> 00:47:08,920
Wanna try?

1286
00:47:08,920 --> 00:47:09,600
Sure.

1287
00:47:09,600 --> 00:47:10,320
(Shy)
I guess we can.

1288
00:47:10,320 --> 00:47:11,240
I think so.

1289
00:47:11,240 --> 00:47:12,520
I'll catch you from below.

1290
00:47:13,320 --> 00:47:14,360
We need shoes for this, right?

1291
00:47:14,360 --> 00:47:15,760
Yeah, you need shoes.

1292
00:47:18,060 --> 00:47:19,740
(Helps her put on the shoes)

1293
00:47:20,720 --> 00:47:21,160
Too tight?

1294
00:47:21,160 --> 00:47:21,920
Just right.

1295
00:47:23,960 --> 00:47:25,160
I'll find you one in a sec.

1296
00:47:26,960 --> 00:47:28,240
There are gloves too.

1297
00:47:29,740 --> 00:47:33,020
(Liquid chalk)

1298
00:47:33,040 --> 00:47:34,560
I'll put some on my hand, then...

1299
00:47:35,320 --> 00:47:36,280
pass it to you.

1300
00:47:38,080 --> 00:47:39,240
No, open your hand.

1301
00:47:39,240 --> 00:47:40,060
Yeah, open it.

1302
00:47:40,140 --> 00:47:41,580
(Helps apply it)

1303
00:47:41,600 --> 00:47:42,600
Like this?

1304
00:47:42,660 --> 00:47:44,700
(Focused)

1305
00:47:45,160 --> 00:47:46,200
Like this?

1306
00:47:52,680 --> 00:47:53,360
Slowly.

1307
00:47:53,360 --> 00:47:54,560
We have to jump down.

1308
00:47:54,560 --> 00:47:54,800
Yeah.

1309
00:47:55,620 --> 00:47:56,940
(Reaches out to catch her)
You're okay.

1310
00:47:58,800 --> 00:47:59,680
Let's go.

1311
00:47:59,960 --> 00:48:00,920
How's your balance?

1312
00:48:01,960 --> 00:48:02,640
Pretty good.

1313
00:48:02,640 --> 00:48:03,420
Pretty good?

1314
00:48:03,420 --> 00:48:05,900
(Supports her as she walks)

1315
00:48:06,200 --> 00:48:07,840
I'll show you first.

1316
00:48:08,240 --> 00:48:09,680
This is how you climb it.

1317
00:48:10,200 --> 00:48:11,640
Live tutorial.

1318
00:48:15,260 --> 00:48:16,340
(Reaches the top in seconds)
He's pretty fast.

1319
00:48:17,280 --> 00:48:18,840
You're telling me you've
never done this before?

1320
00:48:19,440 --> 00:48:21,040
No. I only started here.

1321
00:48:22,320 --> 00:48:23,560
And then you're at the top.

1322
00:48:23,580 --> 00:48:25,500
(Stunned)

1323
00:48:26,360 --> 00:48:27,640
Wait till I get down.

1324
00:48:30,160 --> 00:48:32,000
You made it look so easy.

1325
00:48:32,240 --> 00:48:32,840
Tired?

1326
00:48:32,840 --> 00:48:33,320
Pretty tired.

1327
00:48:34,080 --> 00:48:35,520
Pretty tired.

1328
00:48:36,980 --> 00:48:38,300
(Makes eye contact)

1329
00:48:38,720 --> 00:48:39,640
Which one do you wanna try?

1330
00:48:40,080 --> 00:48:40,280
This one.

1331
00:48:40,720 --> 00:48:41,920
That's the one you just did, right?

1332
00:48:41,920 --> 00:48:42,600
Yeah.

1333
00:48:43,080 --> 00:48:43,720
Push with your foot.

1334
00:48:43,720 --> 00:48:45,600
Just push off like that.

1335
00:48:45,600 --> 00:48:47,060
It's easier from spots like this.

1336
00:48:47,060 --> 00:48:49,540
(Guides her)

1337
00:48:49,600 --> 00:48:50,480
Let's do it together.

1338
00:48:51,440 --> 00:48:52,720
(Protective)
I'll stay below and catch you.

1339
00:48:52,720 --> 00:48:53,200
Just in case.

1340
00:48:53,960 --> 00:48:54,680
In case you slip.

1341
00:48:56,200 --> 00:48:57,600
I'm over here now.

1342
00:48:59,160 --> 00:49:00,080
It's pretty tiring, right?

1343
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:03,680
Let me see how to move you over.

1344
00:49:04,640 --> 00:49:05,680
Yeah, move over now.

1345
00:49:05,680 --> 00:49:07,240
(Nowhere to put her foot)
Then move this foot onto the gray one.

1346
00:49:08,280 --> 00:49:09,640
(Holds her steady)
No, I'll get down.

1347
00:49:10,040 --> 00:49:10,760
Jump.

1348
00:49:10,760 --> 00:49:11,120
You can jump.

1349
00:49:11,520 --> 00:49:11,800
Go ahead.

1350
00:49:11,800 --> 00:49:12,240
Jump.

1351
00:49:12,240 --> 00:49:13,040
You can jump.

1352
00:49:13,040 --> 00:49:13,600
It's okay.

1353
00:49:14,220 --> 00:49:15,300
(Loses her balance)
Oh my God!

1354
00:49:19,260 --> 00:49:21,100
(Love this, keep it coming)

1355
00:49:21,120 --> 00:49:22,320
Why didn't they do this sooner?

1356
00:49:26,280 --> 00:49:27,160
It's soft.

1357
00:49:27,160 --> 00:49:28,080
Sorry.

1358
00:49:28,080 --> 00:49:28,400
It's okay.

1359
00:49:28,640 --> 00:49:29,960
(Awkward)
Sorry.

1360
00:49:29,960 --> 00:49:30,400
It's okay.

1361
00:49:30,740 --> 00:49:31,300
(Steadies her)

1362
00:49:31,320 --> 00:49:32,400
You get up first.

1363
00:49:32,400 --> 00:49:33,920
Wait, let me grab this.

1364
00:49:34,720 --> 00:49:35,400
Your shoe came off?

1365
00:49:35,820 --> 00:49:37,900
(Protecting her from a distance)

1366
00:49:38,000 --> 00:49:39,240
I'm getting shy now.

1367
00:49:42,080 --> 00:49:44,200
Look, you're blushing.

1368
00:49:44,920 --> 00:49:45,920
How can you not be shy

1369
00:49:45,920 --> 00:49:47,440
in a moment like this?

1370
00:49:48,280 --> 00:49:50,000
Those are everywhere.

1371
00:49:50,500 --> 00:49:52,540
(Reaches out to steady her)

1372
00:49:53,460 --> 00:49:54,380
(Holds her steady)

1373
00:49:54,400 --> 00:49:55,280
Get up.

1374
00:49:55,280 --> 00:49:56,720
Wait, my shoe came off.

1375
00:49:56,860 --> 00:49:57,940
(Smiles)

1376
00:49:58,040 --> 00:49:59,200
I look like a mess.

1377
00:49:59,200 --> 00:50:00,320
No, you're fine.

1378
00:50:05,220 --> 00:50:06,420
(Supports himself)

1379
00:50:14,680 --> 00:50:15,480
Now they're quiet.

1380
00:50:15,480 --> 00:50:17,340
(Rubs hands)
This is so awkward.

1381
00:50:17,380 --> 00:50:19,500
(Tugs at shirt)

1382
00:50:19,940 --> 00:50:22,180
(Looks down and smiles)

1383
00:50:24,520 --> 00:50:26,220
You look pretty tired too.

1384
00:50:26,220 --> 00:50:26,940
(Cracks up)

1385
00:50:26,960 --> 00:50:28,080
I am pretty tired.

1386
00:50:31,240 --> 00:50:32,240
That goofy smile.

1387
00:50:32,520 --> 00:50:33,680
Want some more chalk?

1388
00:50:33,680 --> 00:50:34,360
No.

1389
00:50:41,440 --> 00:50:42,960
We can climb together. You stay here.

1390
00:50:42,960 --> 00:50:43,520
I'll be over here.

1391
00:50:44,160 --> 00:50:45,160
If you can't get down,

1392
00:50:45,160 --> 00:50:46,600
just call me right away.

1393
00:50:47,960 --> 00:50:49,400
Love between two little geckos.

1394
00:50:50,720 --> 00:50:52,160
Recommend it to the others.

1395
00:50:52,160 --> 00:50:53,200
(Bohan, Xing, family of four)
Xing and Bohan.

1396
00:50:53,200 --> 00:50:54,000
Yeah.

1397
00:50:54,480 --> 00:50:55,520
They should come too.

1398
00:50:56,280 --> 00:50:57,200
Okay.

1399
00:50:58,560 --> 00:50:59,240
Anything else?

1400
00:50:59,240 --> 00:51:00,080
Nope.

1401
00:51:01,560 --> 00:51:02,680
I'm so full.

1402
00:51:04,040 --> 00:51:05,240
My dress can barely fit anymore.

1403
00:51:08,540 --> 00:51:10,820
(Helps take off the apron)

1404
00:51:10,840 --> 00:51:11,520
Okay.

1405
00:51:11,920 --> 00:51:12,600
Why do those two look

1406
00:51:12,600 --> 00:51:14,000
like an old married couple?

1407
00:51:14,000 --> 00:51:14,600
Just look at them.

1408
00:51:17,120 --> 00:51:18,260
Today, I...

1409
00:51:18,260 --> 00:51:19,560
(Smiles)

1410
00:51:19,560 --> 00:51:21,200
- What're you smiling about?
- Wasn't I the first one back?

1411
00:51:21,200 --> 00:51:22,040
And then?

1412
00:51:22,040 --> 00:51:24,240
Then I went straight over and dropped in

1413
00:51:24,240 --> 00:51:25,080
a Master Kong Jasmine Coin.

1414
00:51:29,180 --> 00:51:33,020
(Three hours ago)

1415
00:51:33,020 --> 00:51:35,220
(Heads straight to the wishing well)

1416
00:51:35,220 --> 00:51:36,960
(Wishing well, stargazing room, city date)
Going to the stargazing room?

1417
00:51:37,640 --> 00:51:38,400
Here we go.

1418
00:51:43,940 --> 00:51:45,380
(Cao Yiheng sends
a stargazing room invite)

1419
00:51:45,400 --> 00:51:46,200
Stargazing room.

1420
00:51:52,140 --> 00:51:56,140
(Cao Yiheng successfully unlocks
the stargazing room)

1421
00:51:57,600 --> 00:51:58,720
Did it go through?

1422
00:51:58,720 --> 00:51:59,360
Yeah.

1423
